    - <BR> Asset Disposition and <BR>
Other Adjustments</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="white-space: nowrap; text-align: center; padding-bottom: 1pt; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 8pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD>
