<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0pt; text-indent: 0.5in"><FONT STYLE="color: Black">In
addition, in connection with the Merger, Cara will assume all of the outstanding options to acquire Tvardi common stock and such
stock options will become exercisable for shares of Cara common stock following the Merger.</FONT></P>

