                                            to Cara&rsquo;s current D&amp;O policy that will be fully utilized at Closing, prepaid R&amp;D
                                            clinical costs of less than $0.1 million, and other prepaid costs of $0.4 million, as these
                                            amounts will either be written-off or fully amortized at the Closing.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

