                                            in general and administrative expenses, resulting from (i)&nbsp;pre-existing employment agreements
                                            or severance plan arrangements for executives and (ii)&nbsp;retention agreements for non-executive
                                            employees that were agreed upon prior to the Merger that had not yet been paid or fully accrued
                                            for as of December&nbsp;31, 2024, assuming that the adjustment described in Note 6(f)&nbsp;was
                                            made on January&nbsp;1, 2024.</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="color: Black">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

